WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.960
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain a science fiction drama film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:16.240
called “Finch.” Spoilers ahead!&nbsp;
Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:22.560
The movie starts with a brief montage of earth&nbsp;
in ruins. A solar flare damaged the ozone layer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:28.080
ten years ago, causing temperatures to&nbsp;
climb to 150 degrees Fahrenheit. Planet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:35.040
Earth has deteriorated into a mostly inhospitable&nbsp;
wasteland, burned by UV radiation and vulnerable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:40.880
to catastrophic weather phenomena. Finch, one&nbsp;
of the few survivors, is shown at the start.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:46.400
He is a robotic engineer equipped with a suit that&nbsp;
protects him from the heat and the UV rays. 
&nbsp;

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.440
Like any other day, he's scavenging for&nbsp;
supplies with his robot Dewey. When he walks
&nbsp;

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:57.120
inside a store, his measurements suggest that&nbsp;
UV radiation levels in the area are quite high.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:03.120
Meanwhile, the robot picks whatever is left in the&nbsp;
store. Finch is then seen taking some dog food.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:08.800
After leaving, he marks the area so that he can&nbsp;
keep track of the places that are scavenged.
&nbsp;

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:13.200
In the next scene, Finch travels through&nbsp;
a deserted town that has been ravaged due&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:18.560
to the ozone layer's depletion. The UV rays&nbsp;
make it impossible for people to go outside.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:23.840
Hence, the majority of the city has been&nbsp;
evacuated. Suddenly, Finch’s suit emits a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:29.120
warning that a storm is approaching. He spins&nbsp;
the truck around and slams on the accelerator,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:34.480
while the giant storm chases him. Luckily, he&nbsp;
manages to reach his underground laboratory,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:39.360
which was formerly owned by the firm for which&nbsp;
he worked before the catastrophe hit. 
&nbsp;

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:44.960
Later, we get to know that Finch is dying&nbsp;
from tuberculosis . His dog cum pal, Goodyear,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:50.400
is waiting for him at his big house. He hugs and&nbsp;
kisses the dog, then prepares the food he found&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:56.960
earlier. While Goodyear eats, Finch merely sips&nbsp;
on a drink as the supplies are running out. Later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:01.680
with the help of an AI, Finch uploads&nbsp;
basic instructions on his new project&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:06.400
like ‘how to care for a dog’ , ‘how&nbsp;
to do household chores’ and so on.
&nbsp;

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:12.000
Since Finch loves Goodyear more than anything, he&nbsp;
is working on creating a highly specialized robot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:23.600
to care for him after his death. Finch has been&nbsp;
conducting a lot of study on UV rays and radiation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:29.440
exposure. Later, he removes Dewey's eyes and&nbsp;
attaches them to his new robot. After turning on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:35.200
the robot, he starts transmitting data to it.
After a lot of failed attempts to communicate, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:40.880
robot finally nods its head, symbolizing that he&nbsp;
is understanding what Finch is trying to convey.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:46.400
Finch is overjoyed by the reaction from the robot&nbsp;
and the fact that he's made it one step further.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:50.720
He also plays with his dog believing&nbsp;
that he might soon have a new friend. 
&nbsp;

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:55.600
Finch then tells the robot to mention something&nbsp;
about himself. The robot says that he has some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.600 --> 00:03:01.360
rules, such as not harming humans, but the&nbsp;
most essential rule is that in Finch's absence,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:07.200
he must take care of Goodyear at all costs. All&nbsp;
of a sudden, the power goes out. Finch heads out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:11.920
to repair the wind turbine. He connects the&nbsp;
cable after which the lights are restored.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:17.600
Inside, the robot names himself Jeff.
Meanwhile, a gigantic storm is seen coming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:23.200
their way. Finch comes back and connects Jeff to&nbsp;
the weather station so he can make a forecast.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:28.480
Jeff says that 4 different storms will approach&nbsp;
them in the next 24 hours and they will not be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:35.200
able to avoid it. He also forecasts that it will&nbsp;
last roughly 40 days. Hearing this, Finch believes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:41.040
that they have to leave the place soon. He also&nbsp;
presumes San Francisco as their best option.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:45.680
Finch then starts to build the robot’s full&nbsp;
body. After finishing it, Finch increases&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:50.800
the robot’s transfer rate and starts teaching&nbsp;
him how to walk. Following a bit of practice,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:56.240
Jeff successfully starts walking. While Finch&nbsp;
is happy with the progress, Goodyear dislikes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.240 --> 00:04:01.600
the robot and doesn't trust him at all. As the&nbsp;
storm gets nearer, Finch starts packing all the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:08.240
essentials and also unplugs Jeff’s data transfer&nbsp;
at only 72 percent. Because of this, Jeff is not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:14.240
fully developed and hence acts like a child.
Finch calls Dewey to join them but forgets that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:19.360
he has removed his eyes. Hence, he attaches&nbsp;
a camera so that he can finally see again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:24.560
The four then climb on an RV and start making&nbsp;
their way to San Francisco. At the start of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:29.600
the ride, Jeff is extremely curious as he&nbsp;
tries to learn everything Finch does. 
&nbsp;

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:34.720
For the time being, the group has successfully&nbsp;
managed to evade the storm. They then stop by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:40.640
a deserted town. Finch wears the UV protection&nbsp;
suit and calls Jeff to join him outside. He then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:46.320
starts teaching Jeff basic instructions on how to&nbsp;
scavenge and also about the hazards of the sun.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:52.240
The duo also has a moment of fun when they pop&nbsp;
some popcorn out in the sun. Yes, that’s how bad&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:57.680
the sun has become! The fun however soon fades&nbsp;
away when Finch notices the storm approaching&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.680 --> 00:05:03.360
them. He gathers everyone and tries to outrun the&nbsp;
storm, but it eventually catches up to them. 
&nbsp;

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:08.720
Finch rushes outside with Jeff and orders him&nbsp;
to help him tie the RV with wires. After Finch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:14.160
gets tired, Jeff takes charge and successfully&nbsp;
completes the task. Finch then gets inside the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:20.560
RV and secures it. Soon, the massive tornado&nbsp;
hits, and all the wires begin to snap one after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:26.720
another until only one is remaining. Luckly,&nbsp;
the storm passes away and everyone is fine.
&nbsp;

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:31.040
Finch appreciates Jeff’s good work but gets&nbsp;
disappointed to learn that the front tire of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:36.960
the vehicle is damaged. They have a spare tire but&nbsp;
do not have a jack to lift the vehicle. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:42.800
Jeff simply lifts the vehicle using his sheer&nbsp;
strength and tells Finch to change the tire. 
&nbsp;

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:47.120
The next morning, Jeff attempts to communicate&nbsp;
with Goodyear saying that he is trying to learn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:52.320
the dog language. But Finch wakes up and makes&nbsp;
him understand that it will take some time for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:56.720
him and Goodyear to be on good terms.
Later that day, a board points out that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.720 --> 00:06:05.120
San Francisco is 1522 miles away. Finch is stumped&nbsp;
when Jeff asks him to explain the notion of trust.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:10.000
Hence he just shares his own life story.
He mentions how he alone solved the software&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:14.320
problem during a project, but gave the&nbsp;
credit to the whole team. In this way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:20.240
he was able to win their trust. All this&nbsp;
time, Finch’s health keeps deteriorating.
&nbsp;

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:24.560
Then stop at a restaurant, where Finch&nbsp;
vomits blood. Realizing that he doesn’t have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:30.240
much time left, Finch takes Goodyear inside the&nbsp;
restaurant and starts playing with him. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:35.840
Jeff is toying with the RV. He puts on songs while&nbsp;
he tries to drive. Because of his clumsiness, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:41.920
lets go of the handbrake, and the RV hits a car.&nbsp;
When Finch confronts Jeff, he acts all innocent.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:47.600
He then reverses the RV, only to crash it again.&nbsp;
A furious Finch demonstrates what happens to his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:52.480
skin when he steps in the sunlight. He then&nbsp;
screams at Jeff, telling him that his only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:56.160
job is to take care of Goodyear.
After they leave the restaurant,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.160 --> 00:07:02.800
Finch decides to teach Jeff driving. At first Jeff&nbsp;
is clumsy as usual, but he soon gets a hang of it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:08.480
and starts driving smoothly. Finch is pleased&nbsp;
at this but the doggo still remains skeptical.
&nbsp;

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:14.160
At night, they stop by the road to camp. There,&nbsp;
the beautiful northern lights can be seen as
&nbsp;

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:19.200
The ozone layer is no longer present. Jeff&nbsp;
suggests that they could drive at night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:23.600
mentioning that daylight is hazardous.&nbsp;
However, Finch teaches him that hungry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:29.360
people approach at night and it's dangerous.
In the morning, Finch vomits blood and is also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:34.560
shivering. Jeff takes good care of him, asking&nbsp;
if he should call the doctor. After that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:39.760
they continue their journey. When they arrive in&nbsp;
a major city, Jeffs wakes Dewey and the duo head&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:44.800
out to scavenge for supplies. They come across&nbsp;
a hospital which looks looted but Jeff is yet to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:49.680
learn that, so he continues his way inside.
When Finch wakes up, he discovers that both the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:55.280
robots are missing. He knows that trouble lies&nbsp;
ahead so despite being extremely weak, he suits&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.280 --> 00:08:01.600
up and sets off to find Jeff and Dewey. Someone&nbsp;
is watching him from the shadows. Upstairs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:07.760
Jeff is delighted to find food, medicine and even&nbsp;
a fancy jacket for himself. Meanwhile, Dewey finds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:13.920
some snacks, but doesn’t notice a bear trap near&nbsp;
it. As he reaches for the snacks, the bear trap&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:20.160
rips him apart. After a distraught Finch finds&nbsp;
him, he apologises and turns off his power.
&nbsp;

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:28.560
Soon, Finch hears a rumbling sound and finds&nbsp;
Jeff as well. Finch stresses that they cannot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:34.160
stay at the place any longer as it is not safe&nbsp;
for them. Both of them then make a run but Finch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:39.360
is barely managing to stay on his feet. When&nbsp;
they reach their RV, they immediately speed away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:43.760
but a vehicle starts following them.
After reaching a bit far, Finch hands over&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:48.880
the steering to Jeff telling him not to make any&nbsp;
mistakes from now on. He also notices the car&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:53.920
still following them. They turn off the headlights&nbsp;
as Jeff is able to see in the dark. While the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:59.440
mystery car still pursues them, Finch suggests&nbsp;
Jeff to step on the accelerator and speed up.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:03.920
As they are driving into a storm, Finch&nbsp;
grabs the wheel and steers it off the road.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:09.120
He intends to use the underpass instead. Despite&nbsp;
Jeff trying his best to explain that the height&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:14.800
of RV is higher than the underpass, Finch does&nbsp;
not listen and eventually it crashes and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:21.520
RV’s solar panels are destroyed. After the crash,&nbsp;
Jeff uses his strength to push the RV inside.
&nbsp;

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:25.840
The car that was following them approaches.&nbsp;
However, It stops for a little moment,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:31.120
and then drives away. After knowing that the&nbsp;
people have gone, Finch rushes outside and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:35.920
discovers that all of their solar panels have&nbsp;
been damaged. He starts blaming himself for his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:41.280
poor judgment and also mentions that he cannot&nbsp;
repair it. Jeff assures him that he can take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:46.960
them to San Francisco but Finch snaps at him to&nbsp;
stop talking. A furious Finch then returns to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:52.480
vehicle while Jeff stands outside in the rain.
After a little snooping, Jeff comes inside and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:56.960
tells Finch that he thinks they'll make it&nbsp;
to the Golden Gate Bridge in San Francisco.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.960 --> 00:10:02.400
Meanwhile, Finch shares another story and relates&nbsp;
why he doesn't trust people and how he discovered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:07.840
Goodyear in a bag. He mentions that Goodyear&nbsp;
was terrified and alone, and how he promised to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:13.600
protect him at any cost. Finch adds that hunger&nbsp;
can turn any good human being into killers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:18.640
but it turned Finch into a coward as he kept&nbsp;
hiding while some young boys killed a young&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:23.360
girl and her mother in the supermarket. 
The next morning, another board points out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:30.000
that it is 480 miles to San Francisco. Jeff is&nbsp;
on the wheel while a weak Finch rests. Suddenly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:35.280
Jeff notices a butterfly on the windshield. He&nbsp;
pulls over, awakens Finch up, and points to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:41.200
butterfly. Finch gets up and stretches his hand&nbsp;
out, only to find it unaffected by the sunlight.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:46.080
He then steps outside and feels the sun;&nbsp;
the UV radiation has decreased to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:53.600
point where it is no longer a threat.
He sees a flower and another butterfly and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:59.520
laughs heartily. As they continue their journey,&nbsp;
they get past flowering plains. Later, Finch gets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:03.840
dressed and they decide to have a picnic in&nbsp;
the sun, something he hasn't done in over a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:08.720
decade. Finch then shares some more memories&nbsp;
of his past, while wishing that he could make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:14.320
more of his life. Hearing this, Jeff excitedly&nbsp;
gets up and explains that if they leave now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:20.800
they will reach the Golden Gate bridge in about 18&nbsp;
hours. However, Finch says that he can't make it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:25.360
A saddened Jeff then promises to take&nbsp;
care of Goodyear when he’s gone.
&nbsp;

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:30.880
After that, Finch brings out Goodyear's ball and&nbsp;
the two engage in a game of fetch. He then hands&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:36.480
the ball to Jeff and explains that this is one of&nbsp;
the first stages in creating trust with the dog.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:41.680
The two then have a brief moment of fun when&nbsp;
suddenly Finch starts coughing up blood. His&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:46.160
white suit is covered in blood now. 
When Jeff asks if he can help him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:52.240
Finch responds he has already done so. He&nbsp;
then shakes Jeff’s hand, and they hug. Here,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:59.040
Jeff is visibly upset and we can see that he has&nbsp;
emotions too. Jeff then assists Finch into the RV,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:04.080
where he lies down. Goodyear consoles&nbsp;
Finch while Jeff packs their belongings.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:10.640
Finch pats his beloved buddy in the back one more&nbsp;
time before passing away. The two then burn Finch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:14.720
in the plains along with his UV suit.
After they are done mourning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:20.720
Jeff continues with the daily routine of Finch and&nbsp;
feeds the dog. Later, they play fetch again. With&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:26.480
Jeff, Goodyear starts to feel safe and begins&nbsp;
to change. Jeff also feels that Goodyear is now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:32.560
his responsibility, and they set off again. He&nbsp;
befriends Goodyear, who finally embraces him.
&nbsp;

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:37.520
When they finally arrive at the Golden Gate&nbsp;
Bridge, Jeff constructs a memorial for Finch.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:41.200
There, they find several messages&nbsp;
left by people for their loved ones,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:45.600
letting them know where they can be found.&nbsp;
This concludes that there are more survivors;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:49.760
with the possibility of family members&nbsp;
being reunited. In the final scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:55.040
Jeff sticks his drawing of Finch, Goodyear,&nbsp;
and himself on the fence. The two of them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:59.040
then leave for somewhere else.
